title: A Torn Page
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: archivist mood=sly

archivist: Come closer, see! 
archivist: I've found a rare page... Perhaps it will be of use.
seeker: I assume there's a catch?
archivist: I can't say what it is {name}, but there is certainly one...
archivist: I think I can remove the curse, for a price.

choice:
  - Take the page (a relic, and a Doubt in your deck) -> take
  - Leave it -> leave
  - [if gold >= 50] Pay 50 gold for it, Doubt removed. -> buy

@take
  > relic random common
  > curse doubt
  archivist: A hasty choice, no doubt.
  > end

@leave
  archivist: Perhaps wise. Safe travels.
  > end

@buy
  > gold -50
  > relic random common
  archivist: Always nice to be paid for my skills.
  > end
